{
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.01": "我以为%79$s已经给收税的交过了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.02": "你可以去问%27$s。事情发生的时候%79$s就在场……我想是的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.03": "听说宫廷还在为%21$s服丧。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.04": "我，呃……听说有人看见%13$s夜里离开了%2$s。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.05": "我听说%7$s已经好几天没在宫廷露面了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.06": "你……听说他们在议论%2$s什么了吗？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.07": "听说%66$s正在起草新的令状。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.08": "听说眼下宫廷里有%119$s位公爵、%120$s位领主，可还是什么都办不成。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.09": "这井水又变味了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.10": "那道篱笆你修好了没有？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.11": "你看着挺累的。抱歉，我只是……看出来了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.12": "我梦见鸡群在密谋对付我。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.13": "我用一双好靴子换了一袋芜菁。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.14": "面包师一口咬定他的面包能治好腰背痛。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.15": "我拿一颗绿宝石跟你赌，这雨撑到黄昏才下。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.16": "据说要是水井一年里干两回，村里就得死人。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.17": "我敢说，那只猫从赶集那天起就一直跟着我。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.18": "昨儿夜里那只狐狸又叼走了我一只鸡。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.19": "我已经一星期没睡个整觉了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.20": "我想跟屠夫讨价还价，结果吃了大亏。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.21": "我觉得邻居家那只鸡中了邪。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.22": "今早的面包没发起来。我娘总说这是凶兆。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.23": "天没亮铁匠就在敲打了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.24": "渔夫好些天没打到东西了。你说是不是出什么事了？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.25": "昨晚铁匠铺附近有人扭打。我听见了，可没敢过去看。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.26": "屠夫要价是上个月的两倍。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.27": "那个傻子想拿一只裂了口的碗按原价卖给我。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.28": "春天那双靴子，我还欠着皮匠的钱呢。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.29": "孩子们又扮了一上午的骑士。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.30": "孩子们一直缠着要学弓箭。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.31": "有人老让自家鸡跑进我的菜园。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.32": "我想一口气搬太多鸡蛋，后来的事嘛，你猜也猜得到。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.33": "我听说今早%69$s从%155$s带来了消息。我……大概不该乱猜。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.34": "听说%7$s开朝议一直开到天黑透了才散。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.35": "听说%7$s一直在打听村子的事。也不知是打听什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.36": "听说跟%155$s的关系缓和了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.37": "听说咱们如今跟%155$s交好了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.38": "有人说%155$s来的使者今天到了。我没问是谁。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.39": "今早有个骑士差点把我撞进泥里。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.40": "你觉得%11$s将来会是个好君主吗？要是你不嫌我多问的话。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.41": "有人把我的衣裳从晾衣绳上偷走了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.42": "昨儿我在地板下摸到三颗绿宝石。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.43": "有人一直在摘我树上的苹果。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.44": "鸟是不留脚印的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.45": "那条狗从我手里直接把香肠叼走了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.46": "我家门又犯那种响动了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.47": "武器匠打了一把新剑。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.48": "新剑没人使，打它又有什么用？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.49": "近来客栈里的人没那么多。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.50": "小心。隔墙有耳。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.51": "王室若要人忠心，就该先从好面包做起。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.52": "我有时会想，%8$s%7$s俯瞰这一切时，心里在想什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.53": "镇上最老的石头见过的君主，比我们这辈子能见的还多。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.54": "每个大家族，都是从某个人站在村中广场上开始的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.55": "我怀念这地方还小得能认得每一张脸的时候。那时候……轻松些。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.56": "孩子们长得比房子盖得还快。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.57": "今天我在客栈附近看见三张生面孔。我没去自我介绍。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.58": "进%2$s的路近来比往常热闹。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.59": "我们有%3$s名居民，却不知怎的只有一处像样的闲聊地。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.60": "%2$s要是再这么扩下去，咱们就得再打一口井了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.61": "首都的闲话足够养活%3$s口人。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.62": "我数了数，有%3$s名居民，其中一半挡了我的道。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.63": "这个时辰，路上的尘土哪儿都是。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.64": "但愿我的床还在我放下的地方。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.65": "我是从面包师那儿听来的，他又是从守卫那儿听来的。所以……算不上亲眼所见。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.66": "闲话就是这么起来的，这回我可不想再背黑锅。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.67": "早些时候我听见些古怪的动静，可没去看。我不确定自己想不想看。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.68": "别跟人说我说过这话。求你。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.69": "我……不想解释。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.70": "我跟你说，那只鸡知道些什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.71": "我这不是迷信。我这是有阅历。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.72": "广场附近的猫越来越有组织了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.73": "有人说该让那只鸡来统治%2$s。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.introverted.call.evening.74": "市场附近又到处都是鸡了。"
}
